@startuml
title UC02 - Create Pet (PetWise MVP)\nInfrastructure + Application + Domain

actor User as U
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "PetController\n(infrastructure)" as C
participant "CreatePetUseCase\n(application)" as UC
participant "PetGateway\n(port)" as GPet
participant "TutorGateway\n(port)" as GTutor
participant "JpaPetRepository\n(adapter)" as APet
participant "JpaTutorRepository\n(adapter)" as ATutor
database "SQLite DB" as DB

== Create Pet Happy Path ==

U -> UI : Select tutor\nFill pet form
UI -> C : POST /api/v1/pets\nPetCreateRequest
C -> UC : execute(command)

UC -> GTutor : findById(tutorId)
GTutor -> ATutor : findById
ATutor -> DB : SELECT * FROM tutor WHERE id = ?
DB --> ATutor : Tutor row
ATutor --> GTutor : Optional<Tutor> (present)
GTutor --> UC : Tutor aggregate

UC -> UC : validate pet data\n(name, birthDate, etc.)

UC -> GPet : createPet(petAggregate)
GPet -> APet : createPet
APet -> DB : INSERT INTO pet(...)
DB --> APet : new row with id
APet --> GPet : persisted Pet
GPet --> UC : persisted Pet

UC --> C : PetResponse DTO
C --> UI : 201 Created\nPet JSON

== Error: Tutor Not Found ==

U -> UI : Submit pet with invalid tutorId
UI -> C : POST /api/v1/pets
C -> UC : execute(command)
UC -> GTutor : findById(tutorId)
GTutor -> ATutor : SELECT ...
ATutor -> DB : no rows
DB --> ATutor : (empty)
ATutor --> GTutor : Optional.empty()
GTutor --> UC : empty

UC --> C : throws DomainException(NotFound: Tutor)
C -> "ApiExceptionHandler" as H : handle(DomainException)
H --> UI : 404 Not Found\napplication/problem+json

@enduml
